<title>USA: Washington Mutual to join S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual to join S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said it will replace Great Western Financial Corp in the S&amp;P 500 Index with Washington Mutual Inc after the close of trading on Tuesday, July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Washington Mutual is acquiring Great Western Financial in a merger scheduled to close on that date.</p>
